WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:07.250
Aichi. You really rushed headlong
into things way too much today, I think.

00:07.250 --> 00:08.920
Yeah. Sorry...

00:09.540 --> 00:12.670
It's okay. But why'd you do something like that?

00:12.880 --> 00:17.670
I don't understand either... It's just, you know
how everyone came to my house the other day?

00:17.670 --> 00:19.750
Yeah. Ai-chan was so cute!

00:19.960 --> 00:26.670
A-at that time too, Airi warmed up towards
Sasaki-kun and... Also, with everyone else, so...

00:26.880 --> 00:28.670
What? She's not allowed to warm up to them?

00:28.670 --> 00:31.880
Oh! It's not that she's not allowed, but...

00:31.880 --> 00:33.000
I see...

00:33.000 --> 00:33.670
Huh?

00:33.920 --> 00:39.920
You didn't like that, right? That Ai-chan warmed up
to the other classmates before a certain someone.

00:40.290 --> 00:41.130
Yeah...

00:41.130 --> 00:44.290
And then you saw Sajotchi in Sasakin,
and got reminded of him?

00:44.290 --> 00:46.000
Y-you can stop that now...

00:46.210 --> 00:49.420
Recently, Sajotchi hasn't been
making passes at you at all.

00:49.670 --> 00:52.380
And Aichi, he's kind of making you feel
confused and frustrated, you know?

00:52.790 --> 00:57.290
Yeah... B-but I don't understand
why I feel that way either...

00:57.500 --> 01:02.330
Maybe for you, Aichi, Sajotchi is most likely one
of the people who you feel you can belong with.

01:02.330 --> 01:07.580
Huh!? He is so not who I belong with!
He stalks me and is annoying.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.500
Rather than whether you feel comfortable
or uncomfortable around him,

01:10.500 --> 01:13.790
doesn't it make you happy that
there's someone who likes you?

01:13.790 --> 01:15.580
W-well, that's...

01:16.000 --> 01:21.460
I think if you suddenly lost a place where you belong,
then anyone would feel uneasy too, you know?

01:21.790 --> 01:24.460
Oh... Kei, you know, you're amazing.

01:24.670 --> 01:29.460
Well, you know Aichi, that awkward side
of you is also cute and I like that.

01:29.670 --> 01:31.830
C'mon, don't tease me anymore.

01:31.830 --> 01:36.750
Sorry, sorry. But there's no guarantee that even
Sajotchi won't move away from you, you know?

01:36.750 --> 01:37.330
Huh?

01:37.630 --> 01:42.290
Aichi, at the very least, Sajotchi has said what
he wanted to say to you up until now, I think.

01:42.290 --> 01:44.380
Daily, to the point of being annoying.

01:44.670 --> 01:47.750
That's why Aichi, maybe it's your turn
to make an effort, you know?

01:47.750 --> 01:48.170
What?

01:48.170 --> 01:49.960
Give me a sip please! Let's trade!

01:49.960 --> 01:51.080
What!? Hey!

01:51.080 --> 01:52.750
Yeah! Chocolate's yummy too!

01:53.000 --> 01:53.630
Oh!

02:11.040 --> 02:15.000
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

02:11.040 --> 02:15.000
<b>is a Realist</b>

02:15.250 --> 02:20.710
Nozoki dasu sora no gourei de omoi kakaeta mama shuppatsu

02:20.710 --> 02:25.420
Me wa au noni kaze de yurete toomawari

02:26.540 --> 02:32.000
Akogare matataki no shutter omoide wa kokoro kazatta

02:32.000 --> 02:37.420
Kono jikan, suki mitai modokashii noni

02:38.460 --> 02:43.330
Hanarete chikazuite akirame kaketa yume

02:43.580 --> 02:49.000
Umaku oritateru hi oikakete mitaina

02:49.000 --> 02:54.420
Joukuu ippai ni natta tsutae kirenai koto

02:54.580 --> 03:00.210
Nazeka iro chigai no kimi no honne surechigatta

03:00.210 --> 03:08.540
Mayotchai sou dakedo sora wa zutto futatsu no kodou

03:08.540 --> 03:11.040
Nando mo tsutaeta

03:11.210 --> 03:17.210
Ao no kanjou kuttsuke tara donna keshiki hirogaru no kana

03:17.210 --> 03:21.880
Irodotta omoi shiritainda

03:28.670 --> 03:31.580
<b>Dark Brown? That Kind of Has a Cool Ring to It</b>

03:30.920 --> 03:32.750
Hey, you're kinda grubby.

03:33.040 --> 03:35.290
Yeah, whatever, so I'm grubby anyway.

03:35.290 --> 03:37.040
That's not it. Your hair.

03:37.040 --> 03:37.500
Huh?

03:38.580 --> 03:39.330
Whoa!

03:39.330 --> 03:40.920
Huh, it's already grown this long.

03:40.920 --> 03:44.500
It stands out more than you think,
so hurry up and get it dyed.

03:44.500 --> 03:45.830
Two-tone color.

03:45.830 --> 03:46.580
Huh?

03:46.580 --> 03:48.000
Conversely, wouldn't it be stylish?

03:48.130 --> 03:52.080
What're you saying? In your case,
it just makes you look unkempt.

03:52.250 --> 03:54.540
For lighter colored hair, you gotta take proper care of it.

03:54.670 --> 03:56.630
Well, I'll get it dyed eventually.

03:56.630 --> 03:59.920
Huh. You know, you used to be more concerned about it.

04:01.580 --> 04:02.460
Well, yeah.

04:03.920 --> 04:08.130
Before, I was trying my best doing lots of things to
become a man who was suitable for Natsukawa.

04:09.500 --> 04:12.210
But now, I kind of feel like I don't need
to be that concerned anymore.

04:12.460 --> 04:15.080
It's not like I'm going to be standing
alongside anyone, so...

04:17.210 --> 04:17.920
Oh!

04:18.380 --> 04:19.000
Oh!

04:19.500 --> 04:21.790
Good morning, Natsukawa-san.

04:21.790 --> 04:24.540
Hey, why are you suddenly being respectful?

04:24.830 --> 04:29.540
Did you think I could behave in a normal way
after what happened yesterday, oh goddess?

04:32.670 --> 04:35.380
Morning, Natsukawa. Also, Ashida.

04:35.380 --> 04:36.330
What am I, the accessory?

04:36.500 --> 04:37.210
You bastard.

04:37.750 --> 04:39.420
Not my shin...

04:41.380 --> 04:43.790
Yesterday, were you two able
to get home safely afterwards?

04:44.630 --> 04:47.130
We drank new frappe items. Right?

04:47.130 --> 04:47.960
Oh, yeah.

04:48.210 --> 04:50.830
Uh-huh. I guess you two had fun.

04:51.210 --> 04:53.460
It was nice and quiet because you weren't there.

04:54.790 --> 04:55.960
Well, of course.

04:56.460 --> 04:58.420
It was a girls-only gathering, so of course.

04:58.710 --> 05:01.710
Aw, it's hot. Sajotchi, fan us.

05:02.170 --> 05:05.460
Honestly, you're such a slave driver.
I guess I have no choice.

05:05.580 --> 05:08.040
There's a limit to how much of
the blazing sun one can take, you know?

05:08.040 --> 05:10.460
Oh no! Do I have enough sunscreen to last?

05:10.830 --> 05:13.290
You're being creepy, so stop that.

05:19.000 --> 05:20.630
<b>Don't need you today.</b>

05:19.000 --> 05:20.630
<b>Understood.</b>

05:19.000 --> 05:20.630
<b>Today</b>

05:19.000 --> 05:20.630
<b>Don't need your</b>

05:19.000 --> 05:20.630
<b>help today either.</b>

05:20.920 --> 05:24.460
That's a relief. Plus, it's a kind of awkward
with Yuuki-senpai in the mix too.  

05:28.080 --> 05:28.790
Oh!

05:35.080 --> 05:35.880
Huh?  

05:36.630 --> 05:39.750
The seats next to the window that
are usually taken are available?

05:40.750 --> 05:43.540
It's okay, right? It should be okay.

05:43.880 --> 05:48.130
<b>A nutritional snack bar you can be</b>

05:43.880 --> 05:48.130
<b>satisfied with, by having just one.</b>

05:44.250 --> 05:45.630
Today at the convenience store,

05:45.630 --> 05:48.130
I ended up buying two of the "You can be
satisfied with, by having just one" snack bars.     

05:48.420 --> 05:51.670
I'll say it again. I'm starting out with
two snack bars and then a pastry!

05:52.040 --> 05:55.880
Today, I simply won't be able to stop myself.
I'll probably end up with overnutrition.

05:56.630 --> 05:58.710
From that back view, is that you, Sajo?

05:58.710 --> 05:59.790
Ugh!

06:02.290 --> 06:03.880
<b>Morals & Discipline</b>

06:03.250 --> 06:06.000
Oh... Yeah. Hi...

06:07.380 --> 06:08.250
Hang on.

06:08.250 --> 06:08.880
Huh?

06:10.040 --> 06:12.630
Don't just resume your meal like normal.

06:12.630 --> 06:13.630
What...?

06:13.630 --> 06:17.500
This is where people normally request something like,
"Would it be okay to share a table?"

06:18.080 --> 06:20.170
Well, but isn't this lineup kind of dangerous?

06:20.830 --> 06:22.000
If one were to think normally,

06:22.000 --> 06:25.380
something like a group of Morals and Discipline
Committee members would be nothing but terror...

06:25.880 --> 06:26.750
Oh...

06:29.330 --> 06:31.170
Who is that angel?

06:31.170 --> 06:33.170
Revise that. She's an archangel.

06:33.580 --> 06:34.670
Your eyes say you're serious.

06:35.000 --> 06:37.790
Sajo-kun! Let's eat together, okay?

06:37.960 --> 06:39.040
Huh? What?

06:39.040 --> 06:42.420
Yuyu is saying so too, so you understand, right?

06:42.420 --> 06:43.670
Uh... Yes.

06:44.540 --> 06:47.500
Sajo-kun, what are you eating?  

06:47.960 --> 06:50.250
A pastry and a little bit of other stuff that
I bought at the convenience store.

06:50.250 --> 06:54.290
Honestly! That's not good!
You need to properly eat healthy things.

06:54.290 --> 06:56.750
Oh, okay. Wait, what the...?

06:56.750 --> 06:58.080
Did she get a boyfriend or something?

06:58.080 --> 06:59.040
There's no way!

06:59.710 --> 07:03.210
M-m-m-my ear! It's gonna come off! It's gonna come off!

07:03.500 --> 07:04.040
Oh!

07:04.580 --> 07:06.170
There's no way.

07:07.250 --> 07:08.000
My apologies.

07:08.210 --> 07:13.880
Sajo-kun, this is the first time you've met Aya-chan,
right? She's my childhood friend.

07:13.880 --> 07:18.330
She's an excellent kouhai who
has nurtured Yuyu up to this point.

07:18.330 --> 07:19.880
Well, that's amazing.   

07:19.880 --> 07:20.710
Well...

07:20.790 --> 07:23.000
C'mon Aya-chan, you're being curt!

07:23.080 --> 07:24.790
Th-that's not true!

07:24.790 --> 07:26.710
Smile. Come one, with a grin.

07:29.130 --> 07:30.750
Nice to meet you.

07:30.750 --> 07:32.460
You don't have to force yourself.

07:32.670 --> 07:36.710
This is for Yuyu's sake. Just so you know,
this isn't for your sake, okay?

07:37.000 --> 07:38.380
C'mon, Aya-chan.

07:38.540 --> 07:39.580
Listen up, Yuyu.

07:39.580 --> 07:44.040
The thing about men is, they're all a bunch of perverts
who'll creepily look at cute girls like you.

07:44.040 --> 07:46.330
But Sajo-kun isn't that kind of person.

07:46.500 --> 07:48.670
That's right. Sajo is a chicken.

07:48.670 --> 07:51.460
Could you please not totally stab me suddenly like that?

07:53.790 --> 07:55.080
You know, that was delicious!

07:55.080 --> 07:57.460
Right? I'm looking forward to tomorrow too.

07:57.920 --> 07:58.960
What is it?

07:58.960 --> 08:01.580
How do you feel, seeing Yuyu's change?

08:01.830 --> 08:05.880
Well, I'm of course surprised. Did you like make
her play otome games or something?

08:06.040 --> 08:10.250
There's no way I would make her do
something like that. Yuyu is my wife.

08:10.250 --> 08:12.130
You know, purin for dessert is nice too.

08:10.540 --> 08:12.130
Then what about Mita-senpai?

08:12.130 --> 08:13.460
She's her mother.  

08:12.130 --> 08:13.460
Which one then...?

08:13.460 --> 08:14.500
I see.

08:15.250 --> 08:17.580
You didn't tell Inatomi-senpai, did you?

08:17.920 --> 08:20.130
Well, was it necessary to tell her?

08:20.500 --> 08:21.540
Not really.

08:21.880 --> 08:23.920
But Senpai, I would've thought you of all,

08:23.920 --> 08:26.380
would make sure I would never get close
to Inatomi-senpai ever again.

08:26.630 --> 08:28.670
There's no way I would do something like that.

08:29.040 --> 08:33.250
I would never disregard the benefactor
who helped change Yuyu.

08:33.540 --> 08:35.170
Huh? "Benefactor"?

08:35.170 --> 08:38.000
Yes. What Yuyu needed at this time,

08:38.460 --> 08:42.290
was to know that the creatures known as boys,
that she is insecure about, have good traits to them...   

08:42.630 --> 08:45.000
The first thing was to gain a starting point from that.

08:45.380 --> 08:47.330
Okay. A "starting point"?  

08:47.580 --> 08:52.960
Yes. Your nods of response and words at
that time were things that gave Yuyu confidence.

08:54.080 --> 08:59.080
Ever since then, what followed was that she swiftly
gained confidence like she was running up stairs.

08:59.330 --> 09:01.830
You know, I didn't do anything significant.

09:02.040 --> 09:04.130
If anything, that was just right.

09:04.460 --> 09:07.670
At least in regard to someone like her,
who is to the point of being excessively shy.

09:07.830 --> 09:08.670
Oh...

09:08.880 --> 09:14.210
Regardless of intentions, the one who gave her
that impetus was none other than you, Sajo.

09:14.750 --> 09:20.290
It was a fluke. Besides, I don't think I'll call out
to her in the same way again, you know?

09:20.580 --> 09:24.830
I don't mind. It's not as if something bad
will happen because of that.

09:25.250 --> 09:27.710
It's just that a good thing happened this time.

09:25.420 --> 09:27.830
I want the almond tofu too, after all.

09:28.040 --> 09:30.580
Well, I guess that's how it was in the end.

09:28.040 --> 09:30.380
Will you get hungry by nighttime?

09:30.790 --> 09:32.460
Have confidence in yourself, Sajo.

09:32.750 --> 09:33.880
"Confidence"?

09:34.080 --> 09:38.880
Not only for Yuyu, but you even solved my problem too.

09:39.040 --> 09:41.580
What? Did I do something?

09:42.130 --> 09:47.080
Yes. Just as you said, I gave my kouhai a pat
on the back, with a "Don't let it get to you."

09:47.790 --> 09:51.630
And then Yuyu looked happy and began
to lean into me and... Oh wow!

09:51.920 --> 09:54.080
"Oh wow!"? Uh, Senpai...?

09:54.080 --> 09:57.630
But I never expected that
you were Kaede's younger brother.

09:58.000 --> 10:00.330
So, you are acquainted with Big Sis after all.

10:00.630 --> 10:03.210
Yes, from the very beginning when we were 1st-years.

10:03.830 --> 10:07.330
So, from around the time when she dyed her hair blond
the day after she started school,

10:07.330 --> 10:09.250
when she set out on her gyaru debut.

10:07.330 --> 10:09.250
<b>Note: Gyaru = Japanese fashion sub-culture.</b>

10:09.500 --> 10:12.250
I had a hard time dealing with her back then.

10:12.630 --> 10:15.790
What can I say, but that as
her younger brother, I apologize.

10:16.000 --> 10:20.000
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

10:16.000 --> 10:20.000
<b>is a Realist</b>

10:21.830 --> 10:22.540
Oh!

10:23.080 --> 10:24.000
Sasaki?

10:24.330 --> 10:25.920
You not feeling well or something?

10:26.540 --> 10:27.000
Huh?

10:27.000 --> 10:30.000
<b>Yuki</b>

10:27.000 --> 10:30.000
<b>Big Brother, what're</b>

10:27.000 --> 10:30.000
<b>you doing right now?</b>

10:28.000 --> 10:30.000
<b>Who are you talking to?</b>

10:29.500 --> 10:30.000
<b>Is there someone next to you?</b>

10:30.380 --> 10:33.290
Yuki-chan, huh? What happened after that?

10:33.290 --> 10:35.790
When I got home, she got
her elementary school backpack and...

10:35.790 --> 10:39.580
No, never mind. Anyway, when I'm not home,
it's been like this the whole time.

10:39.920 --> 10:41.080
My condolences.

10:41.670 --> 10:43.250
Whose fault do you think this is!?

10:43.630 --> 10:44.380
Oh!

10:44.380 --> 10:50.420
<b>New messages</b>

10:44.380 --> 10:50.420
<b>Missed calls</b>

10:45.000 --> 10:48.040
Well, but isn't it cute since she's a little sister?

10:48.330 --> 10:50.420
Sajo, you have an older sister too, right?

10:50.420 --> 10:51.790
Yeah, one creature.

10:52.080 --> 10:53.670
Since she's your big sister, is she kind?

10:53.960 --> 10:57.880
Oh... Yeah, it's a relationship that can't be summed
up into one word.

10:58.130 --> 10:59.960
It helps that you're quick to understand.

11:00.170 --> 11:02.880
Or rather, given that you know
you have a little sister like that,

11:02.880 --> 11:05.540
fawning over Natsukawa's little sister is what's wrong.

11:05.540 --> 11:08.080
That's not it! It's not Airi-chan that I...!

11:08.080 --> 11:08.540
Oh!

11:08.630 --> 11:10.540
You know, I end up drinking
the limited time items when they come out.

11:10.750 --> 11:11.750
You got a minute?

11:11.750 --> 11:13.130
Huh? Yeah.

11:15.920 --> 11:16.920
I see.

11:16.920 --> 11:18.670
"I see."? But Sajo...

11:18.880 --> 11:20.920
I'm not going to make objections over that.

11:20.920 --> 11:24.630
If anything, is there any guy who exists in this world
who wouldn't have a crush on Natsukawa?

11:24.830 --> 11:28.330
That I don't know, but... But Sajo, you also still...

11:28.540 --> 11:30.380
The one who decides is Natsukawa, right?

11:30.710 --> 11:31.380
Oh...

11:31.830 --> 11:36.710
You know, it's not as if I have any right to do
this or that. But I will be treating you coldly.

11:36.710 --> 11:38.380
Wait, you're going to treat me coldly?

11:38.580 --> 11:42.830
Yeah. You wouldn't like it, if your favorite pop idol
suddenly seemed to have a guy around her, right?

11:46.330 --> 11:48.710
Sajo, I'm seriously setting my sights on her.

11:50.540 --> 11:52.130
What're you getting all fired up for?

11:53.170 --> 11:55.330
What is Sasaki worried about?

11:55.710 --> 11:58.580
I mean, Natsukawa is my top recommendation, right?

11:59.290 --> 12:02.080
I knew that someday a day like this might come.

12:02.830 --> 12:07.000
I'm no longer going to think that an unobtainable beauty
like Natsukawa and I could ever be this or that.

12:07.580 --> 12:12.130
But, if possible, I'd like her to get together with a guy,
who'd be at the "well, of course, if it's him" level.

12:12.750 --> 12:17.250
Is Sasaki worthy of that?
I suppose he's not a bad guy, but...

12:17.710 --> 12:21.210
Alright! I'm going to let myself
ascertain that from the sidelines.

12:21.210 --> 12:21.880
Huh!?

12:24.170 --> 12:28.380
Sasaki is already in Airi-chan's favor,
plus he's a good-looking guy.

12:29.000 --> 12:33.580
It's probably better that I'm no longer
near Natsukawa after all, right?

12:36.750 --> 12:37.380
Sajo!

12:37.380 --> 12:37.750
Oh!

12:37.960 --> 12:41.380
These got mixed in with the class next door.
Could you hand them back out?

12:42.170 --> 12:43.750
Why are you asking me to do it?

12:43.750 --> 12:46.040
Because you were nearby. Take care of it.

12:46.040 --> 12:47.580
Oh, okay...

12:47.750 --> 12:48.250
Oh!

12:48.250 --> 12:49.750
<b>Mathematics 1</b>

12:48.250 --> 12:49.750
<b>1-C Aika Natsukawa</b>

12:50.790 --> 12:51.170
Natsu...

12:51.460 --> 12:52.960
Natsukawa, did you see it too?

12:52.960 --> 12:53.420
Yeah.

12:53.880 --> 12:54.630
Oh!

12:54.630 --> 12:55.080
Huh!?

12:55.080 --> 12:57.540
Ashida, could you hand this to Natsukawa?

12:57.830 --> 12:58.170
What?

12:58.540 --> 13:00.710
Sajotchi, why don't you hand it to her yourself?

13:00.710 --> 13:02.670
Sorry, but I'm in a rush.

13:02.670 --> 13:05.000
What, the restroom? Run, run!

13:05.000 --> 13:05.920
You're a lifesaver.

13:06.380 --> 13:08.420
Hey, the rest of these too?

13:15.960 --> 13:17.170
You know, they're open.

13:17.170 --> 13:18.130
That's not it.  

13:18.130 --> 13:19.170
Uh-huh...

13:19.540 --> 13:20.790
Oh...

13:31.500 --> 13:32.250
Huh!?

13:35.960 --> 13:38.580
Natsukawa!? What in the world...? You're cute.

13:38.580 --> 13:39.960
I-I'm not cute!

13:40.210 --> 13:43.080
Weren't you heading home with
Ashida and the others just now?

13:43.080 --> 13:44.540
Huh!? How...?

13:44.750 --> 13:47.380
I just happened to see you. Did you forget something?

13:47.630 --> 13:49.670
Oh, yeah... Something like that.

13:50.290 --> 13:52.130
It's already late, so be careful.

13:52.290 --> 13:53.210
Oh...

13:54.580 --> 13:55.710
Want me to go with you?

13:55.920 --> 13:58.330
Oh... Yeah.

14:04.080 --> 14:05.210
Was it there?

14:05.210 --> 14:07.960
Oh, yeah. Don't rush me so much.

14:07.960 --> 14:09.960
That's good. Oh!

14:09.960 --> 14:10.790
Uh...

14:10.790 --> 14:11.630
What's up?

14:11.630 --> 14:14.500
That reminds me, I did have
business with you too. Maybe.

14:14.500 --> 14:15.830
What? With me?

14:15.830 --> 14:18.290
I-it's not like it's anything important.

14:18.670 --> 14:22.000
It's just that I made a promise with Kei
that I'd ask you by the end of day.

14:22.000 --> 14:23.290
About what?

14:23.830 --> 14:27.130
L-lunch. Where do you always go when it's lunch break?

14:27.330 --> 14:31.880
What!? I try eating meals on the bench in
the inner courtyard or eat at the cafeteria and so on.

14:32.080 --> 14:33.380
W-with who?

14:33.880 --> 14:35.130
You know, by myself.

14:35.130 --> 14:40.880
Why are eating by yourself? I mean,
you should eat together, you know? With everyone.

14:41.130 --> 14:45.130
Okay. Oh, but today, I ate with the members
of the Morals and Discipline Committee.

14:45.130 --> 14:47.880
With Shinomiya-senpai and Inatomi-senpai and...   

14:48.330 --> 14:49.830
Shinomiya-senpai?

14:49.830 --> 14:51.210
Huh? Yeah.

14:51.210 --> 14:52.880
Why? What's your relationship with her?

14:53.040 --> 14:54.790
Oh no, I just happened to come across them.

14:55.040 --> 14:59.750
What's my relationship?
I think we just have a normal senpai-kouhai relation,

14:59.750 --> 15:01.920
and she happens to be my big sis' friend too.

15:02.130 --> 15:03.830
I-is that so...

15:04.330 --> 15:05.040
Yeah...

15:07.500 --> 15:09.710
What's with this awkward atmosphere!?

15:11.290 --> 15:12.500
And us?

15:13.080 --> 15:13.630
Huh?

15:13.630 --> 15:16.630
Like before... Aren't you going to eat with everyone?

15:16.880 --> 15:20.540
Oh, everyone, as in... Yeah, that's...

15:23.250 --> 15:26.880
By me maintaining a distance,
there will be something that changes.

15:27.380 --> 15:30.580
In fact, Natsukawa made new friends.

15:30.880 --> 15:35.250
By me being around, there is the possibility, that
Natsukawa's springtime of life will end up fading away.

15:36.000 --> 15:40.580
In that sense, also rooting for Sasaki's crush
could be a possibility too, maybe?

15:42.460 --> 15:43.580
I definitely don't want that.

15:43.880 --> 15:44.580
What!?

15:45.000 --> 15:45.580
What!?

15:45.920 --> 15:49.460
Oh, no, I was just saying I definitely
don't want the end-of-term results to come out.

15:49.830 --> 15:52.210
Natsukawa, what're your thoughts regarding that?

15:52.210 --> 15:53.540
What's up with that?

16:02.130 --> 16:04.830
You know that hair of yours,
why don't you do something about it?

16:05.460 --> 16:08.580
I even got told by my big sis that this was grubby.

16:09.210 --> 16:13.710
Things like first impressions can end up changing a lot,
so you should hurry and do something.

16:14.170 --> 16:16.080
I will stop by the drug store on my way home.

16:16.750 --> 16:19.790
By the way, black hair, or brown hair;
which do you think is better?

16:19.790 --> 16:22.500
Well, that depends on the person
and what color looks best on them.

16:22.750 --> 16:26.920
Well, yeah. Then for me, brown hair,
or black hair; which seems better?

16:26.920 --> 16:28.000
What? But I just...

16:28.250 --> 16:33.790
That was a general opinion, right? Natsukawa, I was
asking you, as to what you think might be better.  

16:33.790 --> 16:34.670
Well...

16:34.670 --> 16:35.630
Oh! Huh!?

16:36.290 --> 16:40.460
This kind of situation is what I'm talking about,
Natsukawa-san! Ah, the wafting scent coming from you!

16:41.250 --> 16:41.830
Yeah.

16:41.830 --> 16:43.000
Wh-what do you think?

16:43.330 --> 16:44.710
I'm kind of okay with either.

16:44.710 --> 16:46.130
Well, that's not helpful.

16:46.130 --> 16:47.130
Oh, but...

16:47.130 --> 16:47.880
Yeah?  

16:48.290 --> 16:52.830
If you'd been brown-haired at that time,
I might not have called out to you then...

16:53.000 --> 16:54.540
What!? "That time"?

16:59.670 --> 17:02.420
Then Natsukawa, I'll go with something to your liking.

17:02.420 --> 17:04.630
I-it's not like my preference.

17:04.630 --> 17:07.420
Plus, I'm okay with either one too. Well, I'll play it safe.

17:07.630 --> 17:10.290
You understand, right? It's not like my preference, okay?

17:10.920 --> 17:12.420
I know that.  

17:13.920 --> 17:15.920
<b>Dyes thoroughly!</b>

17:13.920 --> 17:15.920
<b>Dark Brown</b>

17:14.080 --> 17:16.500
Oh no! There's no black dye.

17:16.830 --> 17:18.170
Dark Brown?

17:18.170 --> 17:21.670
<b>Hair Color</b>

17:18.170 --> 17:21.670
<b>Staff recommended!!</b>

17:18.170 --> 17:21.670
<b>Currently selling well!</b>

17:18.790 --> 17:21.000
That kind of has a cool ring to it.

17:21.670 --> 17:23.670
<b>Dyes thoroughly!</b>

17:21.670 --> 17:23.670
<b>Dark Brown</b>

17:22.250 --> 17:25.500
I have to stay still like this for 20 minutes, huh?

17:25.670 --> 17:26.420
Oh!

17:27.420 --> 17:30.000
It stinks! Close the door, will ya?

17:30.000 --> 17:32.250
I can't touch it because of these.

17:32.250 --> 17:33.670
Dark Brown?

17:34.080 --> 17:36.790
Yeah, there wasn't any black dye, so I decided on
that.

17:37.040 --> 17:40.210
Then that should be fine.
This turns out really black at the beginning.

17:40.580 --> 17:41.330
Is that so?

17:41.580 --> 17:43.750
You suck. You're making it uneven.

17:43.750 --> 17:44.540
What!?

17:44.540 --> 17:45.920
Here, move over a bit.

17:45.920 --> 17:46.830
Oh, okay.

17:47.210 --> 17:47.960
Thanks-

17:47.960 --> 17:49.580
Hang on, rubber gloves!?

17:49.580 --> 17:51.460
I'm getting a bad feeling about this, but...

17:51.790 --> 17:52.540
Oh, hey!

17:52.540 --> 17:54.750
I'm telling ya, you can't haphazardly do hair dyeing.

17:54.750 --> 17:57.040
Ow! Don't be so rough! My hair's gonna fall out!

17:57.040 --> 17:58.630
You'll be fine!

17:58.630 --> 18:00.000
Ouch!

18:00.540 --> 18:01.130
See?

18:01.130 --> 18:03.420
Y-yeah... Hang on, isn't it too black?

18:03.750 --> 18:06.830
I told you; it'll be kind of like that for a while.

18:07.250 --> 18:10.920
Well, if you wash it vigorously,
then it'll have a natural look in about two days.   

18:11.210 --> 18:12.960
Just as I'd expect from a former blond gyaru.

18:13.210 --> 18:15.460
You know... I'll kick your ass.

18:16.960 --> 18:23.460
<b>Wataru Sajo</b>

18:16.960 --> 18:23.460
<b>1st Trimester   Final Exams   Ranking</b>

18:16.960 --> 18:23.460
<b>65th place</b>

18:17.330 --> 18:21.670
Motivation. That is something that
anyone can be influenced by at any time.

18:21.670 --> 18:23.460
It is the driving force of action.

18:24.330 --> 18:28.540
Children run around outside from the motivation
that wells up from deep within their bodies.  

18:29.040 --> 18:33.380
And middle schoolers take a fancy to mysterious
fantasies and embody them. (A certain class of them.)

18:33.750 --> 18:37.130
And then after they go through puberty,
they awaken to fleeting emotions.

18:37.130 --> 18:41.170
And they think about the object of their affection,

18:41.330 --> 18:44.250
and they channel the passion that wells up,
into their very own driving force!

18:44.460 --> 18:48.790
Especially for boys. In other words,
when it comes to what I am trying to say, it is that...

18:49.960 --> 18:52.540
I guess to be in love, was incredible...

18:52.750 --> 18:55.750
<b>Wataru Sajo</b>

18:52.750 --> 18:55.750
<b>1st Trimester   Final Exams   Ranking</b>

18:52.750 --> 18:55.750
<b>65th place</b>

18:53.330 --> 18:55.630
I was ranked 32nd for the midterm exams.   

18:56.210 --> 19:01.380
I do have an idea of why. Before, I had like a will
of steel that "I'd keep up with Natsukawa."

19:01.750 --> 19:10.290
<b>University</b>

19:01.750 --> 19:10.290
<b>Acceptance</b>

19:01.750 --> 19:10.290
<b>Results</b>

19:02.000 --> 19:05.000
In the first place, this is a rather good preparatory school.

19:05.130 --> 19:10.000
If I hadn't been so deeply attached to Natsukawa,
then I don't think I could've even gotten in here.

19:10.710 --> 19:14.750
In other words, well, I guess compared to last time,

19:14.750 --> 19:17.330
clearly this time, I didn't have the motivation to study.

19:17.330 --> 19:18.540
Sajotchi, what rank were you?

19:18.750 --> 19:19.630
The hell!?

19:20.080 --> 19:21.040
You're going to hell?

19:21.040 --> 19:21.670
Uh...

19:21.670 --> 19:23.040
Sorry, my bad.

19:23.420 --> 19:25.130
I was 74th.

19:25.380 --> 19:26.040
What?

19:26.330 --> 19:30.630
So, is this one of those things? Where you told
me yours, so I have to tell you mine?

19:32.500 --> 19:34.540
See, mine's fluctuated violently.

19:34.920 --> 19:38.460
Huh? Sajotchi, weren't you a lot higher last time?

19:38.460 --> 19:40.040
Well, I don't really remember.

19:40.710 --> 19:45.920
Wow. I'd asked with the sense you'd probably be within
the top 50 again, so this was unexpected.

19:46.210 --> 19:49.960
Look who's talking. What kind of result
is 76th place for you?

19:50.210 --> 19:51.580
74th place!

19:52.000 --> 19:52.960
Yeah, yeah.

19:53.330 --> 19:55.420
Why are you that boastful?

19:55.830 --> 19:58.250
Do you remember my previous ranking?

19:58.250 --> 19:59.460
I don't remember that.

19:59.790 --> 20:02.580
220th place! Isn't this a huge leap forward!?

20:02.960 --> 20:04.580
So, you were an idiot.

20:04.580 --> 20:07.080
Past tense, okay? I'll allow it if it's past tense.

20:07.630 --> 20:11.000
Hey Sajo, what rank were you? I was 230th place!

20:11.250 --> 20:13.670
Yeah, it's nice you seem happy.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.210
Huh? Yeah.

20:17.580 --> 20:19.540
Our idol and goddess.

20:18.960 --> 20:21.460
<b>1st Trimester   Final Exams   Ranking</b>

20:18.960 --> 20:21.460
<b>1st place</b>

20:18.960 --> 20:21.460
<b>2nd place</b>

20:18.960 --> 20:21.460
<b>Claudine Marika Shinonome</b>

20:18.960 --> 20:21.460
<b>Aika Natsukawa</b>

20:19.540 --> 20:20.790
Aika Natsukawa.

20:21.670 --> 20:23.790
As usual, she's highly capable!

20:24.040 --> 20:25.960
What is that person doing by himself?

20:25.960 --> 20:27.920
Yeah. He's being weird, you know? Right?

20:28.250 --> 20:30.170
Wow. Okay. Let's stop.

20:29.210 --> 20:32.920
Before, I was in 32nd place and
Natsukawa was in 27th place.

20:33.290 --> 20:36.380
I guess I was rather in the way of
her exam studying, after all.

20:37.210 --> 20:37.630
Oh!

20:37.630 --> 20:40.880
<b>Claudine Marika Shinonome</b>

20:38.170 --> 20:40.580
Is the person in first place a foreign exchange student?

20:41.080 --> 20:43.330
Aichi! Please split half of it with me!

20:43.880 --> 20:44.710
O-of what!?

20:44.710 --> 20:46.750
Well, let me see...

20:47.040 --> 20:49.460
The old me would've been there for sure.

20:49.460 --> 20:51.000
That's not true!

20:50.420 --> 20:53.790
But the Natsukawa that I can gaze
upon from far away isn't bad either.

20:51.000 --> 20:53.920
Please give me some! Just kidding!

20:54.630 --> 20:58.210
Natsukawa, you have grown up, haven't you?
I feel blessed to be a fan.

20:58.210 --> 20:58.960
Sajo!

20:58.960 --> 20:59.580
Huh?

21:01.290 --> 21:04.830
What's up Sasaki? Did your little sister steal it at last?

21:04.830 --> 21:05.880
Steal what!?

21:08.250 --> 21:09.670
Your heart.

21:09.670 --> 21:11.710
That's not it! My test ranking!

21:12.080 --> 21:15.080
What!? Sasaki, you're talking about a topic
that's not related to your little sister!?

21:15.080 --> 21:15.920
See?

21:15.920 --> 21:16.710
Huh?

21:16.670 --> 21:18.920
<b>29th place</b>

21:16.670 --> 21:18.920
<b>Takaaki Sasaki</b>

21:19.040 --> 21:20.290
Not bad.

21:20.630 --> 21:25.080
Right? Speaking of, Sajo, have you not been
able to keep up with studying? Well?

21:26.250 --> 21:27.540
There you go, taunting me.

21:27.540 --> 21:30.670
You know, it gets on my nerves that you
still look good even with a sarcastic attitude.

21:30.790 --> 21:33.210
Well, it's because I worked hard this time.

21:31.960 --> 21:34.170
Hang on, this is a serious situation.

21:33.580 --> 21:38.080
Although, I was busy with club activities, you do what you gotta do.

21:34.170 --> 21:38.420
For a student like me who's not the good-looking type,
my weapon is humanities as a whole.

21:38.540 --> 21:39.670
In other words, studying.

21:39.920 --> 21:44.170
And I just can't accept that a good-looking bastard
from the soccer club is taking that away.

21:44.540 --> 21:48.830
Whoa! My motivation has been pulled up
from an unexpected direction!

21:49.750 --> 21:52.710
I wish all of your passes end up as offside violations!

21:53.080 --> 21:56.460
Dude, you know, you just said a rather terrible thing.

21:58.460 --> 21:59.540
I get that!

21:59.540 --> 22:00.210
Yeah!

22:00.210 --> 22:00.830
Oh!

22:01.170 --> 22:02.170
It's dyed!

22:02.500 --> 22:03.290
Whoa!

22:03.290 --> 22:05.080
Hey Sajotchi, you okay!?

22:05.500 --> 22:08.250
Yeah. I just died from a surprise attack, that's all.

22:08.630 --> 22:09.380
Huh?

22:28.500 --> 22:30.960
Mou, shitsukoi! Danante, ne

22:31.250 --> 22:34.540
Aa. Iwanakya yokatta na...

22:35.380 --> 22:41.500
Demo ne nande sona kyuu ni sokkenai kao shite kuruno...

22:43.210 --> 22:45.420
Kidoku no mama oitekebori na message

22:45.420 --> 22:47.710
Demo group dato henshin aru mitai na

22:47.920 --> 22:49.880
Chikai to omottara tooku natte

22:50.130 --> 22:51.670
Nande konna sabishin daro

22:51.670 --> 22:53.540
Kyou wa oikakete... kurenai no?

22:53.540 --> 22:55.080
Sunao ni naretara ii noni

22:56.540 --> 23:02.880
Datte hajimete shitta no konna setsunai kimochi ga aru kototte...

23:02.880 --> 23:04.290
Nanoni, nee!

23:04.290 --> 23:05.830
Doushite itchau no??

23:05.830 --> 23:07.580
Nande naisho nano!?

23:07.790 --> 23:09.960
Modokashii darake de...

23:09.960 --> 23:11.330
Aa! Aa!

23:11.330 --> 23:13.040
Ienai yo konna no

23:13.040 --> 23:17.040
Dakedo sakki wa honne janai kara

23:17.040 --> 23:18.420
Tsutawatte yo

23:18.500 --> 23:20.130
Doushite okotchau no...

23:20.130 --> 23:21.670
Kawaiku dekinai no...

23:21.670 --> 23:24.130
Kirai ni natta no...??

23:24.290 --> 23:27.000
Aa! Aa! A, aa!

23:29.000 --> 23:29.960
Doushite

23:30.630 --> 23:31.920
Kirai ni naranai de

23:34.960 --> 23:36.330
...Kiite, "Anone...!"
